# Dependencies — devDependencies only; there is no runtime dependency and no build.
#
# NO TRAILING SLASH, deliberately. `node_modules/` matches a DIRECTORY only, and
# `nix run .#deps` replaces this with a SYMLINK into the Nix store — which that
# pattern does not match, so git staged the link. Measured 2026-09-28.
node_modules

# Lint / tool caches
.eslintcache

# Nix
# `result` is a build symlink; `.direnv/` is direnv's cached dev shell. Both are
# regenerated from flake.nix + flake.lock, which ARE committed.
result
result-*
.direnv/

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local environment
# `.envrc` is COMMITTED (it holds the load order, never a value); `.envrc.local`
# is the per-operator file and must never be. The `.env*` glob below would
# otherwise swallow `.envrc` too.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.envrc
.envrc.local

# There is NO build output in this repository. If you find yourself adding a
# dist/ ignore, stop and open an issue first — a build step changes what a
# reviewer is reading relative to what a user executes.
